W:-----
W:Lyrics
W:--------
W:Sthyi
W:--------
W:Gaavo baagesari (Sing bageshree)
W:Mrudu lagat sur ga ni (It has komal Ga and Ni)
W:Kharaharapriya thaat (It belongs to Kharaharapriya thaat -- Kafi scale)
W:Tivar karat dha ri (It has tivra Dha and Ri)
W:---------
W:Antara
W:---------
W:Madhyama kare jaan (Its life is Ma - vaadi is Ma)
W:Samavadi saa maan (Its samvaadi is Sa)
W:Panchama kare alpa (The usage of Pa is very little)
W:Ri Sa ni, Dha, ni, Sa ma ga ga (Catch phrase)
W:Ma Dha ni Dha, ma Pa ga Ri Ri Sa (Catch phrase)

